<section
  id="call-for-papers"
  aria-labelledby="call-for-papers-title"
  class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,_#ffffff_0%,_#f8fafc_40%,_#eef2ff_100%)] py-20 text-slate-900 sm:py-24"
>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-10 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-slate-300 to-transparent"></div>
  <div class="absolute left-[-7rem] top-16 -z-10 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-cyan-300/15 blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="absolute right-[-8rem] top-24 -z-10 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-violet-300/15 blur-3xl"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-cyan-700/80">
        Contributions
      </p>
      <h2
        id="call-for-papers-title"
        class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.05em] text-balance text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl"
      >
        Call for Papers
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-lg">
        Prospective authors are invited to submit high-quality papers representing original work. Innovative submissions in all areas of information gathering are welcome. Accepted papers will be presented in an interactive poster session at the IROS 2026 conference and hosted on the workshop website as non-archival submissions.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_0.9fr]">
      <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200/80 bg-white shadow-[0_30px_80px_-40px_rgba(15,23,42,0.18)]">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200/80 px-6 py-5 sm:px-8">
          <p class="text-[0.72rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-cyan-700/80">
            Submission overview
          </p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-slate-950">
            Guidance for Authors
          </h3>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6 px-6 py-6 sm:px-8 sm:py-8">
          <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-500">
              Paper length
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
              Papers should be up to 6 pages in length including all appendices.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-500">
              Submission format
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
              All papers must be in English and submitted electronically in PDF format via <a class="font-semibold text-cyan-700 underline decoration-cyan-300 underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-cyan-800" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScdd2xMSqVevQUHkBbH7cbntlAoH9oIMkbsY5k9-345UZAh1Q/viewform?usp=header">submit here</a>. Use of the conference template is recommended.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-500">
              Review note
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
              Replace this note with the final review-policy text once the submission process is confirmed. Keep any anonymity guidance visible here so authors can find it quickly.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <aside class="space-y-6">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200/80 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,_#0f172a_0%,_#111827_100%)] p-6 text-white shadow-[0_30px_80px_-40px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)] sm:p-8">
          <p class="text-[0.72rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-cyan-100/70">
            Downloadable files
          </p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-white">
            Template links
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">
            Use of the conference templates are not required and are provided for convience.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <a
              href="#latex-template-placeholder"
              class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-[1.25rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-4 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-white/10"
            >
              LaTeX Template
            </a>
            <a
              href="#word-template-placeholder"
              class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-[1.25rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-4 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-white/10"
            >
              Microsoft Word Template
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200/80 bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-40px_rgba(15,23,42,0.22)] sm:p-8">
          <p class="text-[0.72rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-violet-700/80">
            Practical reminder
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">
            Keep any placeholder fields visibly marked until the final submission instructions, deadlines, and review details are confirmed.
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
